VoteCounter.java
Problem: Count how many votes each candidate received.
Constraints:

Votes are given as names in an array
Sample Input:
["Tom", "Jerry", "Tom", "Spike", "Jerry", "Tom"]
Sample Output:
Tom: 3
Jerry: 2
Spike: 1
Approach:

Count using getOrDefault()

Optionally sort by vote count using List + Collections.sort